          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained increases in Western military aid to Ukraine prompt Russia and its partners to accelerate transfers of kamikaze drones, anti-ship missiles and exportable targeting gear to Iran and allied militias, which materially raise proxy capacity to execute maritime attacks." />
