          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.62" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained increases in Western military aid to Ukraine raise Russian incentives to offset losses and sanction-pressure by accelerating bilateral arms transfers and permissive brokering to partners like North Korea, raising the volume of weapons and delivery systems entering DPRK networks." />
