          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter export controls and vetting on AI and dual‑use tech reduce legal channels and increase compliance risk for Chinese intermediaries, diminishing Beijing's ability to supply or broker operationally valuable tech to Pyongyang and thereby lowering external patrons' operational leverage over DPRK decision‑making." />
