          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A surge in weapons and munitions shipments in regional sea lanes leads shipowners and operators to withdraw or refuse employment of tankers for voyages to/through affected ports or zones, shrinking the deployable tanker stock." />
