          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Increased shipments from North Korea of anti-ship missiles, cruise missiles, sea-skimming munitions, drones and naval mines directly raise Iranian-proxy strike capability and enable a higher tempo of maritime attacks against military and commercial vessels." />
